  - name: Klimaschutzplaner Export Mainz 1990-2024
    authority: Landeshauptstadt Mainz -- Grün- und Umweltamt; export from the 
      Klimaschutzplaner tool
    url:
    description: 'Historical BISKO final energy and emissions for Mainz as held in
      the Klimaschutzplaner, exported per sector sheet (Private Haushalte, GHD/Sonstige,
      Industrie, Kommunale Einrichtungen, Verkehr). Authoritative for 1990-2018 only:
      from 2020 the export carries Heizöl values identical to Erdgas, zeroes Fernwärme,
      Biomasse and Solarthermie, zeroes Kommunale Einrichtungen, and leaves 2024 empty.;
      Attachment: Stationär_1990-2023_KSP_Gesamtbilanz.xlsx; Format: .xlsx; Licensing:
      Provided to the city; not public; Geographic Coverage: Mainz (AGS 07315000);
      Update Frequency: Superseded -- no further updates expected; Date Last Updated:
      2026-01-27; Updated by: Landeshauptstadt Mainz'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Schornsteinfeger-Datenservice Mainz 2024 (Feuerstätten)
    authority: Schornsteinfegerinnung / Datenservice Rheinland-Pfalz via 
      Landeshauptstadt Mainz
    url:
    description: "Register of heating appliances in Mainz for 2024: counts of single-room
      and central appliances by fuel (biomass -- split into logs, pellets and chips
      -- natural gas, LPG, heating oil, coal) and by rated capacity class. Delivered
      2026-03-31. Contains no sector breakdown and no consumption; final energy is
      derived from mean capacity and default full-load hours given in the workbook's
      own Lookup sheet.; Attachment: KESSELANZAHL_Feuerstätten_Mainz_2024_EKA-RLP-Datenservice.xlsx;
      Format: .xlsx; Licensing: Provided to the city for climate accounting; not public;
      Geographic Coverage: Mainz (AGS 07315000); Update Frequency: Annual (2024 is
      the first year delivered); Date Last Updated: 2026-03-31; Updated by: Datenservice
      Rheinland-Pfalz"
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Schornsteinfeger-Kehrbuchdaten Mainz 2023 (Feuerstätten)
    authority: Bevollmächtigte Bezirksschornsteinfeger Mainz via 
      Landeshauptstadt Mainz, Grün- und Umweltamt (Kommunale Wärmeplanung)
    url:
    description: 'Chimney-sweep register (Kehrbuch) counts of heating appliances in
      Mainz for 2023, by fuel (biomass, natural gas, LPG, heating oil, coal) and rated
      capacity class, single-room and central appliances separately. Delivered 2026-09-14.
      Same table shape as the 2024 EKA-RLP delivery but without its biomass-by-type
      sub-table and without the Lookup sheet, so the conversion to final energy uses
      the parameters of that workbook. Contains no sector breakdown and no consumption.;
      Attachment: 20260914_Mainz_Schornsteinfeger_2023.xlsx; Format: .xlsx; Licensing:
      Collected by the city under WPG § 11 for the municipal heat plan (Kommunale
      Wärmeplanung); not public; Geographic Coverage: Mainz (AGS 07315000); Update
      Frequency: Annual; Date Last Updated: 2026-09-14; Updated by: Landeshauptstadt
      Mainz, Grün- und Umweltamt'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Schornsteinfeger-Kehrbuchdaten Mainz 2024-2025 (Feuerstätten)
    authority: Bevollmächtigte Bezirksschornsteinfeger Mainz via 
      Landeshauptstadt Mainz, Grün- und Umweltamt (Kommunale Wärmeplanung)
    url:
    description: 'Chimney-sweep register (Kehrbuch) counts of heating appliances in
      Mainz for 2024 and 2025, same structure as the 2023 delivery. Delivered 2026-09-10.
      Its 2024 block is identical, appliance for appliance, to the 2024 EKA-RLP Datenservice
      workbook, which the extractor asserts; both are therefore named on the 2024
      rows. The 2025 block is read and reported but not published, because the model’s
      history ends in 2024.; Attachment: 20260910_Mainz_Schornsteinfeger_2024_2025.xlsx;
      Format: .xlsx; Licensing: Collected by the city under WPG § 11 for the municipal
      heat plan (Kommunale Wärmeplanung); not public; Geographic Coverage: Mainz (AGS
      07315000); Update Frequency: Annual; Date Last Updated: 2026-09-10; Updated
      by: Landeshauptstadt Mainz, Grün- und Umweltamt'
    edition:
    target: data_point
